kind: AdaptiveDialog
modelDescription: |-
  Purpose: Retrieve and display the most recent ServiceNow incidents created by or associated with the current user.

  Use when user asks:

  To view their recent tickets or incidents

  To list previously created incidents

  To check their latest ServiceNow requests/incidents

  Examples (user utterances):

  “Show my recent incidents”

  “List my last ServiceNow tickets”

  “What tickets did I create recently?”

  “Get my latest incidents”

  “Show my last 5 incidents”

  “Do I have any open incidents?”

  “Fetch my recent ServiceNow requests”

  “What are my recent helpdesk tickets?”
